  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp; and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is a&nbsp;vector such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">i</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">j</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;and projection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> , then the projection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> equals:&nbsp;"
  },
